 R←Test_28(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;html
⍝ Text taken from the error (EM) and from `addToMsg` is HTML-escaped
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 #.⎕SHADOW'HandleErrorParms'
 #.HandleErrorParms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 #.HandleErrorParms.saveErrorWS←0
 #.HandleErrorParms.addToMsg←'a<i>b'
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder

 ⎕TRAP←(405 'E' '406 ##.HandleError.Process #.HandleErrorParms')(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 :Trap 406
     {'x<b>y & z'⎕SIGNAL ⍵}405
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 →T.GoToTidyUp 406≠⎕EN
 list←FilesAndDirs.ListFiles #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder,'/*.html'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢list
 html←⊃⎕NGET⊃list
 →T.GoToTidyUp∨/'x<b>y'⍷html
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'x&lt;b&gt;y &amp; z'⍷html
 →T.GoToTidyUp∨/'a<i>b'⍷html
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'a&lt;i&gt;b'⍷html

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir #.HandleErrorParms.errorFolder
